# {{ theme.name }} Helix Theme

> [!IMPORTANT]
> This repository is a read-only mirror.
> Issues, pull requests, and stars should go to [{{ slug }}]({{ theme.repository }}).

Helix editor themes for {{ theme.name }}. {{ theme.description }}

## Installation

Clone the repository and symlink or copy the theme files:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/{{ owner }}/{{ theme.id }}-helix.git
cp {{ theme.id }}-helix/*.toml ~/.config/helix/themes/
```

Then add to your Helix config (`~/.config/helix/config.toml`):

```toml
theme = "{{ theme.id }}-{{ first.variant.id }}"
```
{% for v in variants | slice(start=1) %}
Or for {{ v.variant.id }}:

```toml
theme = "{{ theme.id }}-{{ v.variant.id }}"
```
{% endfor %}
